# Skill discovery

- NEVER enumerate or load full skill lists into context — they are indexed; search instead.
- Need a capability? Run `skillfind "<intent>"` in terminal → read the ONE top SKILL.md path it returns.
- Rules lookup: `rulesfind "<topic>"`; audit always-on token cost with `rulesfind --always`.
- Hot set (ops + skill authoring) is pre-listed in `~/.agents/skills-catalog/CATALOG.md` — read that file, not source dirs.
- Archived skills (`~/.skills-archive/`) are searchable and readable by path; restore with `mv ~/.skills-archive/<name> ~/.claude/skills/<name>`.
